      "width": 1279.7,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "Note: the horizontal bands are lanes (who does the work), circles are start and end events, and diamonds are gateways (branches).\nAn arrow that crosses a lane is a handover, and handovers are where BPMN processes most often go wrong.",
